94, "end": 548.78, "text": "Cute."}, {"start": 551.9, "end": 553.82, "text": "Oh no, I lost it."}, {"start": 553.82, "end": 554.66, "text": "Oh no."}, {"start": 554.66, "end": 555.5, "text": "Oh no."}, {"start": 562.5, "end": 564.0, "text": "I'm trying to try your thing."}, {"start": 565.38, "end": 566.3, "text": "10 seconds."}, {"start": 566.3, "end": 567.78, "text": "What the fudge and mustard."}, {"start": 567.78, "end": 569.02, "text": "I gotta get at least one."}, {"start": 570.0, "end": 572.0, "text": "And that's time."}, {"start": 572.0, "end": 574.0, "text": "I don't even know."}, {"start": 574.0, "end": 577.0, "text": "Jessica, solid effort. Amazing."}, {"start": 577.0, "end": 581.0, "text": "You got one, two, three, four, five?"}, {"start": 581.0, "end": 584.0, "text": "I was, like, moving around like a snake on this thing."}, {"start": 584.0, "end": 586.0, "text": "I literally felt like these machines that you put"}, {"start": 586.0, "end": 588.0, "text": "pennies in and they're like, I have your thing."}, {"start": 588.0, "end": 589.0, "text": "All right, great."}, {"start": 589.0, "end": 590.0, "text": "That is the way it felt."}, {"start": 590.0, "end": 592.0, "text": "Good snack, bad snack. What do we got?"}, {"start": 592.0, "end": 593.0, "text": "Big snack, bad snack."}, {"start": 593.0, "end": 594.0, "text": "What is this?"}, {"start": 594.0, "end": 595.0, "text": "Beef jerky."}, {"start": 595.0, "end": 596.0, "text": "Oh, all right, that's great."}, {"start": 596.0, "end": 597.0, "text": "It's not so bad."}, {"start": 597.0, "end": 599.0, "text": "No, that's just no salt licorice."}, {"start": 599.0, "end": 602.74, "text": "no salt licorice. I see what you did there. You led with the salt licorice. It's like"}, {"start": 602.74, "end": 605.52, "text": "oh, beef shirk-eat. Well, congratulations for your win."}, {"start": 605.52, "end": 608.92, "text": "Thank you very much. It was an honor to compete with you always, John."}, {"start": 608.92, "end": 609.92, "text": "It was. This is decent."}, {"start": 609.92, "end": 610.92, "text": "You want one of this?"}, {"start": 610.92, "end": 611.92, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 611.92, "end": 612.92, "text": "I'm good."}, {"start": 612.92, "end": 613.92, "text": "Oh my god."}, {"start": 613.92, "end": 614.92, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 614.92, "end": 615.92, "text": "It's classic."}, {"start": 615.92, "end": 619.72, "text": "Okay, so in this episode of Snack Boy Showdown, Jessica is the winner."}, {"start": 619.72, "end": 620.72, "text": "She is."}, {"start": 620.72, "end": 621.72, "text": "Absolutely."}, {"start": 621.72, "end": 622.72, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 622.72, "end": 623.72, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 623.72, "end": 629.72, "text": "For incredible athletic ability in such games as flipping a cup."}, {"start": 630.0, "end": 631.8, "text": "I've been getting a hoop onto a chock."}, {"start": 631.8, "end": 635.16, "text": "And noise impressions, amazing."}, {"start": 635.16, "end": 636.4, "text": "And noise impressions."}, {"start": 636.4, "end": 639.28, "text": "I will walk away with a moment forever in my life."}, {"start": 641.08, "end": 642.68, "text": "Thank you for that, that Bible."}, {"start": 644.08, "end": 646.72, "text": "Warm hold in there for at least the next 25 years."}, {"start": 646.72, "end": 647.92, "text": "I'm gonna beat you."}, {"start": 647.92, "end": 648.76, "text": "Oh yeah."}, {"start": 648.76, "end": 651.12, "text": "Like if you were here and I was here, I'd be..."}, {"start": 651.12, "end": 652.96, "text": "I'm gonna beat you."}, {"start": 652.96, "end": 654.52, "text": "But not the way you're thinking."}, {"start": 654.52, "end": 657.16, "text": "I mean, physical violence."}, {"start": 657.16, "end": 658.92, "text": "I love working with Chris."}, {"start": 658.92, "end": 659.92, "text": "Aw, man."}, {"start": 659.92, "end": 660.92, "text": "Ha ha ha."}]